      {
        "text": "I watched your introductory announcement of your candidacy.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "You emphasized that the issue is more important than partisanship.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "You have not formally declared yourself a socialist.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The upcoming vote involves Max Miller.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Max Miller is the primary reason I invited you on this morning.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Most of your policy positions are very far left of center.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
